      "id": "q6",
      "content": "$A \\cup [B \\cap (A \\cup C)]$",
      "hint": "Distribuez l'union : $A \\cup [B \\cap (A \\cup C)] = (A \\cup B) \\cap (A \\cup A \\cup C)$."
    },
